<BaseLayout title="From fanout research to deeper SEO evidence" description="The disclosed optional workflow from one AI Fanout run through SEO Fanout research into real Crawl Foundry demand and site evidence." canonicalPath="/workflow/" pageClass="reference-page">
  <header class="reference-hero workflow-hero"><p class="mono-label">Optional connected workflow · same operator</p><h1>Move from observed search behaviour to real SEO evidence.</h1><p>The SEO research brief is complete before Crawl Foundry appears. Continuing is optional and does not make any of the three commonly owned products independent validation.</p></header>
  <section class="workflow-steps" aria-label="Connected workflow"><article><span>01</span><div><h2>Observe one fanout</h2><p>AI Fanout performs one provider request and shows only the query strings and sources exposed in that bounded run.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>Read the SEO pattern locally</h2><p>SEO Fanout reuses that visible result without another AI request. It groups wording, preserves source scope and records unresolved evidence.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>Verify against real data</h2><p>Crawl Foundry can add keyword demand, current pages, Search Console, crawl evidence and an owned workflow. Those checks are separate from the fanout observation.</p></div></article></section>
  <section class="relationship-disclosure" aria-labelledby="relationship-title"><div><p class="mono-label">Commercial relationship</p><h2 id="relationship-title">Connected products, not independent proof.</h2></div><div><p>AI Fanout, SEO Fanout and Crawl Foundry are operated by Matthias Ramahi. The connection exists because each stage has a different job: observation, interpretation and operational evidence.</p><p>No account is required for AI Fanout or SEO Fanout. The current SEO Fanout-to-Crawl Foundry step opens the relevant Crawl Foundry product area; it does not claim an automatic workspace import.</p></div></section>
  <section class="reference-section action-band"><div><p class="mono-label">Choose a step</p><h2>Start one run or continue with deeper evidence.</h2></div><div class="workflow-actions"><a class="button-link" href="https://ai-fanout.com/#tool">Run AI Fanout</a><a class="button-link secondary-link" href="https://crawlfoundry.com/features/keyword-database?utm_source=seo-fanout.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=workflow">Open Crawl Foundry · same operator</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
